ercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2003-03-3831</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">5 of 7 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Onur Asante</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Knowledge Management</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Expert Witness (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Peter Nachum</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Executive Assistant to the CEO</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Restructuring Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Lucy Nishimura</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Governance Specialist</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Environmental Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Yusuf Bullock</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Digital Channels</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Community Representative</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Vincent Goodman</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Sustainability</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Program Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Kayla Clark</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Financial Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Government Pricing Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Executive Session: CEO Performance Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Executive Session: CEO Performance Review was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA). The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s accommodation process and confirmed that it was in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for growth:</strong> RESOLVED, that the EMEA Leadership Council shall enter into executive session to discuss confidential matters.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Yusuf Bullock &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Lucy Nishimura</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY2003</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY2003 as presented by Vincent Goodman. The analysis in Exhibit B highlighted a need for policy changes to align with new regulations. After discussion of the implementation challenges, the committee voted to approve the new policy framework.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To establish:</strong> RESOLVED, that the EMEA Leadership Council adopts the revised Technology Roadmap and Investment Plan for FY2003 policy, which shall supersede all prior policies on this matter, effective immediately.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Onur Asante &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Kayla Clark</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee discussed the Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review, a review of the company&#x27;s political and lobbying activities. The committee approved the lobbying disclosure report for the previous quarter.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To authorize, subject to conditions:</strong> RESOLVED, that the EMEA Leadership Council approves the divestiture of the Esports Organizations business unit to Skyridge Advisors for a total consideration of $98M.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Kayla Clark &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Vincent Goodman</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of the latest proxy advisor guidance on Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Chukwuemeka Rao</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Notify affected employees of compensation changes in advance of effective date</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Jadwiga Cotton</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Evaluate the effectiveness of the company&#x27;s whistleblower hotline</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Brad Christian</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s digital transformation strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Sebastian Jung</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Circulate draft revised policy language for committee review prior to next meeting</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Ann Jeong</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">6</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Assess the tax implications of the proposed deferred compensation plan changes</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Sakura Obasi</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2003-04-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 12:30 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2003-04-08</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Kayla Clark</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Chief Financial Officer, Government Pricing Advisor (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2003/03/14/platform-business-model-and-ecosystem-strategy-7572/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2003/03/15/vendor-contract-renewal-3345/segment-profitability-analysis-1052/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt